WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.600
Saved posts are easy to collect and hard to use.

00:03.600 --> 00:09.200
Unstash imports Reddit's official saved-post CSV directly in your browser.

00:09.200 --> 00:13.800
No Reddit login. No OAuth token. No upload.

00:13.800 --> 00:19.400
Choose an action, search the queue, finish an item, and export to Markdown.

00:19.400 --> 00:24.000
The CSV importer is live. Next: a permission-light browser extension.

00:24.000 --> 00:29.000
Open source. Private by default. Try it now.
